  "semantic_constraints": ["Preserve axis direction, scale logic, and the relative positions of all major marks.", "Do not invent, remove, or merge visible data groups, categories, clusters, or standout outliers.", "Keep all visible text logically attached to the same chart regions even if the styling is redrawn.", "Preserve point-cloud shape, relative density, and any isolated outlier points.", "Honor this requested polish direction without breaking the data semantics: Redraw as a publication-ready scientific scatter plot with a light pastel palette, larger axis labels, subtle gridlines, and a clean white background. Preserve all data positions, axis ranges, point shapes by species, and the title."],
